  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaADToAddressConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaADToAddressConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaADToAddressConceptMap\"> </a><p>Mapping from (not specified) to (not specified)</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html\">AD: PostalAddress (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address\">Address</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.country\">AD.item.country</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address#Address.country\">Address.country</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le composant country de l’adresse CDA alimente directement Address.country.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.state\">AD.item.state</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address#Address.state\">Address.state</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le composant state de l’adresse CDA alimente directement Address.state.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.county\">AD.item.county</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address#Address.district\">Address.district</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le composant county de CDA est rapproché de Address.district dans FHIR.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.city\">AD.item.city</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address#Address.city\">Address.city</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le composant city de l’adresse CDA alimente directement Address.city.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.postalCode\">AD.item.postalCode</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address#Address.postalCode\">Address.postalCode</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le code postal CDA alimente directement Address.postalCode.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.streetAddressLine\">AD.item.streetAddressLine</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address#Address.line\">Address.line</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Chaque streetAddressLine CDA alimente une ligne d’adresse FHIR.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.streetName\">AD.item.streetName</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Address.line.extension[iso21090-ADXP-streetName].valueString</td><td>Le nom de rue CDA alimente la valeur de l’extension officielle HL7 iso21090-ADXP-streetName portée par Address.line.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.item.houseNumber\">AD.item.houseNumber</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Address.line.extension[iso21090-ADXP-houseNumber].valueString</td><td>Le numéro de voie CDA alimente la valeur de l’extension officielle HL7 iso21090-ADXP-houseNumber portée par Address.line.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-AD.html#AD.useablePeriod\">AD.useablePeriod</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Address#Address.period\">Address.period</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>La période d’utilisation de l’adresse CDA alimente Address.period.</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
